# shadhil-crm (apps/web) — Conventions

This is a **Next.js 16 App Router app that consumes `@paalstack/react-ui`**.
For library-side knowledge (component APIs, props/composition conventions,
build, batched release) load the global `paalstack-react-ui` skill at
`~/.hermes/skills/devops/paalstack-react-ui/SKILL.md`. Don't duplicate
that here.

---

## Imports

```tsx
// UI components — umbrella package
import { Button, Card, Form, Box, HStack, Heading, TypographyP, toast }
  from '@paalstack/react-ui';

// Server-safe utilities — /lib sub-path
import { cn, logger, HttpError, httpClient } from '@paalstack/react-ui/lib';

// Hooks — client-only, separate package
import { useDisclosure, useLocalStorage } from '@paalstack/react-hooks';

// Icons — ALWAYS from a family sub-path, never the root barrel
import { LuSettings, LuMoon, LuSun } from '@paalstack/react-icons/lu';
```

### Icons

- Sub-paths: `/lu` (Lucide, default) · `/hi2` · `/fa6` · `/tb` · `/md` · `/ri` · `/bi` · `/bs` · `/fi` · `/io5` · `/rx` · `/si` · `/pi` · `/vsc` · `/go`.
- Never `import { LuUser } from '@paalstack/react-icons'` (root barrel).
- Never install `lucide-react`, `heroicons`, or `react-icons` directly.

### Never use native HTML elements in JSX

Replace with PaalStack components:

```tsx
// ❌ Never
<div> <header> <main> <section> <nav> <footer> <h1>-<h6> <p> <span>
// <button> <ul> <ol> <li> <code> <blockquote>

// ✅ Layout — Box + `as` prop
<Box as="header" /> <Box as="main" /> <Box as="section" /> <Box as="nav" />

// ✅ Typography — named exports (the Typography.* namespace is undefined
//    under Turbopack)
<TypographyH1 /> <TypographyH2 /> <TypographyH3 />
<TypographyP /> <TypographyMuted /> <TypographyCode />

// ✅ Dynamic heading level — `as` override on Heading
<Heading as="h2" />

// ✅ Button — replaces <button>
<Button />
```

### Styling

- Semantic tokens: `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`,
  `bg-accent`, `bg-card`, `bg-background`, `bg-sidebar`. No raw hex when
  a token exists.
- Extend with `className`; merge via `cn` from `@paalstack/react-ui/lib`.
- Brand overrides for shadhil-crm live in
  `packages/ui-tokens/brand.css` — edit there for primary/secondary/
  surface, not in `globals.css`.
- Cascade in `src/styles/globals.css` is intentional and order-sensitive:
  `@paalstack/react-ui/all.css` → `@shadhil/ui-tokens/brand.css` →
  `tailwindcss`. Do not reorder.

