## Project layout (ground truth, August 2026)

```
apps/web/src/
├── app/                          # Next.js App Router
│   ├── layout.tsx                # Root layout — Inter font, <Providers>, <SiteHeader>
│   ├── page.tsx                  # Phase-1 landing (force-dynamic)
│   ├── not-found.tsx             # (force-dynamic)
│   └── api/
│       ├── auth/[...all]/route.ts    # better-auth catch-all
│       ├── health/route.ts           # GET /api/health
│       └── docs/page.tsx             # API docs landing
├── components/
│   └── SiteHeader.tsx            # Phase-1 placeholder header
├── lib/
│   ├── auth.ts                   # Re-exports { auth, authClient } from @shadhil/auth
│   ├── env/{env.ts,index.ts}     # @t3-oss/env-nextjs + zod (see "Env")
│   └── query-client/{lib.ts,index.ts}  # TanStack QueryClient singleton
├── providers/
│   ├── providers.tsx             # Client provider tree
│   ├── query-provider.tsx        # QueryClientProvider wrapper
│   └── index.ts                  # barrel
└── styles/
    └── globals.css               # Cascade entry point
```

**This is the scaffold that exists today.** Folders like `src/apis/`,
`src/services/`, `src/hooks/queries/`, `src/hooks/mutations/`,
`src/schemas/`, `src/features/`, `src/stores/`, `src/types/`,
`src/utils/`, `src/components/ui/`, `src/components/shared/`, and
`src/libs/{axios,error,logger,db,supabase,rbac,rate-limit}/` are
**planned but not built**. Do not create them speculatively — when
Phase 2 needs them, add a single module at a time and update this rule.

